यो लोकत्रयमाविश्य बिभर्त्यव्यय ईश्वर: ॥ १७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4091,\"bb\":3596,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/15/17/b3596/\",\"body_value\":\"uttamaḥ puruṣas tv anyaḥ
